78cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"书所见","author":"贡性之","text":"使者徵兵夜度关，南人无奈北风寒。\n将军空受登坛拜，羞向灯前把剑看。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29047,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"桃花双鸟图","author":"贡性之","text":"茂陵帝子宴瑶池，翠管银笙取次吹。\n王母不来桃未熟，可怜双鸟立多时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29048,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"云山图二首 其一","author":"贡性之","text":"百折溪流路转深，湿云低压树阴阴。\n山中底事如秦晋，刚被渔郎说到今。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29049,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"云山图二首 其二","author":"贡性之","text":"閒身閒看白云閒，更爱青山懒出山。\n别起楼台半空里，只教钟鼓落人间。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29050,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题竹","author":"贡性之","text":"翩翩ㄠ凤下晴空，半入江云半落风。\n忆昔潇湘泊船处，玉箫声断月明中。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29051,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"墨蒲萄","author":"贡性之","text":"酒醒西楼月欲斜，满窗晴影走秋蛇。\n狂夫剩有相如渴，一滴凉州未许赊。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29052,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"枯木竹石","author":"贡性之","text":"怪石荦确厓谷深，凉风萧瑟苍雪阴。\n美人何处解长佩，湘波澧水劳余心。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29053,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题画","author":"贡性之","text":"月明风静夜如何，船向三江七泽过。\n凉影满篷成独坐，半听楚调半吴歌。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29054,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"柯博士竹","author":"贡性之","text":"丹丘遗老旧词臣，历代图书鉴赏频。\n閒却玉堂挥翰手，墨池染出凤毛新。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29055,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}}]